# IBM-1 kernels copied in for the embodied controllers.  they are 15 MB each and
# are published at huggingface.co/jacob-valdez/ibm-1 under implicit/ -- pinned by
# sha256 in each bundle's manifest.json, so the copy is reproducible and does not
# need to live in two repos.  IBM-1's own rule is that weights are never
# committed; this keeps that true on both sides of the join.
/data/models/*/kernel.pt
